# Task 12. Local launch profile uses 5080; Docker Compose defaults to 8080.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Send six times within one minute with default limits: five 401s, then 429.
# The deliberately absent credentials avoid creating or locking a real account.
# The 429 must be application/problem+json with common.too_many_requests,
# a traceId and Retry-After (seconds). Wait that long before sending again.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"","password":""}

### Registration does not share the login quota: still 422 even after login returns 429.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"invalid","password":""}

### Profile authentication does not share the login quota: still 401.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
